-q-67f17a01695c1f34d245"]}],"accounts":[]},{"id":"liusima-e-o132","title":"温恢赴凉州道病卒，时年四十五","time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["liusima-q-f886ceb57697a5567d32","liusima-q-60d272e09d7cb8900f05"]},"order":3339,"participants":[{"person":"chengguo-p0023","role":"道病卒，时年四十五；卒后被追愍褒奖","evidence":["liusima-q-f886ceb57697a5567d32","liusima-q-60d272e09d7cb8900f05"]},{"person":"wudi-p0170","role":"诏褒恢有柱石之质，服事先帝功勤明著，及为朕执事忠于王室，授万里之任，如何不遂吾甚愍之，赐恢子生爵关内侯","evidence":["liusima-q-60d272e09d7cb8900f05"]},{"person":"liusima-p0044","role":"温恢子，受赐爵关内侯","evidence":["liusima-q-60d272e09d7cb8900f05"]}],"accounts":[]},{"id":"hancui-e-1685dd5682f2c2c083c9","title":"孙礼私纵犯法马台自首温恢白曹操两人减死","time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["hancui-q-1a2b429226964923222e"]},"order":4981,"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0031","role":"纵囚自首","evidence":["hancui-q-1a2b429226964923222e"]},{"person":"hancui-p-0486205b9fd135","role":"获纵减死","evidence":["hancui-q-1a2b429226964923222e"]},{"person":"chengguo-p0023","role":"白事","evidence":["hancui-q-1a2b429226964923222e"]},{"person":"cao-cao","role":"减死","evidence":["hancui-q-1a2b429226964923222e"]}],"accounts":[]}],"persons":[{"id":"chengguo-p0023","name":"温恢","evidence":["chengguo-q-ee3917cc7f22f638be28","liusima-q-6a9eb3b6c03d531dcd9b","liusima-q-22fa782cfbf504c9dfba","liusima-q-350bc172c319b34af315","liusima-q-1c84f108fba1f8eb0177","liusima-q-1044bbd2c5b448daf2ce","liusima-q-f886ceb57697a5567d32","liusima-q-60d272e09d7cb8900f05","liusima-q2-d67f064fec46425a2d58","liusima-q-13bbdbe79d3f464e0013","liusima-q-d4d9c0a5938afbdb08f3","liusima-q2-cf8d0bbf9e73861bdddd","hancui-q-1a2b429226964923222e"],"facts":[{"id":"liusima-f2-89452e991248726a6129","text":"字曼基，太原祁人。父恕为涿郡太守；恢十五岁丧父，送丧归乡里。","evidence":["liusima-q2-d67f064fec46425a2d58"]},{"id":"liusima-f2-d4fba1d45969ba67cd05","text":"举孝廉，为廪丘长，迁鄢陵、广川令，彭城、鲁相，入为丞相主簿。","evidence":["liusima-q-13bbdbe79d3f464e0013"]},{"id":"liusima-f